      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "i feel like rather than an \"all on/all off\" chatboxes need a block per user option. Because you know some desktop user is gonna drop an N-bomb, then all users suffer because you have to turn off all text boxes to hide it. have it on by default, let you set it to friends only if you want, and Allow you to block it on a per-user basis for those that are toxic twats with their text.",
